The plugin fetches the micromamba 2.9.0-0 standalone bootstrap from its
official release after the user consents. Its platform SHA-256 digests are
pinned in src/runtime.ts.
https://github.com/mamba-org/micromamba-releases/releases/tag/2.9.0-0

runtime/*.tsv records the exact conda-forge archive path, SHA-256 and byte
count from an explicit solve for each platform. The environment includes
Python 3.14.10, Manim Community 0.22.1, Typst Python bindings 0.15.2 and
FFmpeg 9.0.2. The installer keeps upstream license files under env/licenses.
https://conda-forge.org/

After local setup consent, automatic narration uses the official Kyutai
Pocket TTS v4.0.1 native release (archive filenames report 3.3.0), under the
MIT license. The package includes a copy of that license for the upstream
English 18M config, changed to use only local model and tokenizer paths.
https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts/releases/tag/v4.0.1
https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts/blob/a922b912dfa366975294afb568d815b305acde5d/pocket_tts/config/english_18m_2026-10.yaml

